She wants to be blank engineer.

82
00:04:15.172 --> 00:04:17.838
A, a. B, an. C, the.

83
00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.455
The answer is B: an.

84
00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.891
A doctor for your teeth is a blank.

85
00:04:27.191 --> 00:04:30.868
A, dentist. B, pilot. C, farmer.

86
00:04:34.883 --> 00:04:37.011
The answer is A: dentist.

87
00:04:38.517 --> 00:04:40.226
He blank to be a journalist.

88
00:04:40.526 --> 00:04:43.564
A, want. B, wants. C, wanting.

89
00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.642
The answer is B: wants.

